---
import BaseLayout from '@/components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About AI Career Guide" description="Learn about the mission and team behind AI Career Guide.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">About AI Career Guide</h1>
  <div class="mt-8 prose prose-lg max-w-none 
  text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] 
  prose-headings:text-[var(--color-text-primary)] 
  prose-a:text-[var(--color-accent)] prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline 
  prose-strong:text-[var(--color-text-primary)] 
  prose-ul:text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] prose-ol:text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] marker:text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">    
      <p>
        <strong>AI Career Guide</strong> is a publication dedicated to helping people build meaningful careers in artificial intelligence, technology, and software engineering.
      </p>
      <p>
        We believe that practical skills, real projects, and clear career strategies are the keys to success in the AI era. Our content is focused on <strong>what to learn, how to build, and how to turn those skills into a career</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our mission is to cut through the hype and provide actionable, trustworthy guidance for anyone – from beginners to experienced professionals – who wants to grow in the tech industry.
      </p>
      <h2>What We Cover</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>AI & ML</strong> – Machine learning, deep learning, LLMs, generative AI, AI engineering.</li>
        <li><strong>Career</strong> – Roadmaps, job roles, interview preparation, salary insights.</li>
        <li><strong>Projects</strong> – Hands‑on tutorials from beginner to advanced.</li>
        <li><strong>Tools</strong> – Curated lists and reviews of AI and developer tools.</li>
        <li><strong>Resources</strong> – Books, courses, datasets, APIs.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We are independent and reader‑supported. We may earn commissions from affiliate links, but we only recommend products we genuinely believe in.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you have any questions, suggestions, or collaboration ideas, please <a href="/contact">get in touch</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
